  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's a little weird feeling that my index finger does not actually go down all the way when resting it on the trigger. I get this was by design, but it just feels kind of awkward that I can lower all of my fingers with equal amounts of pressure, except for my index finger. Where it takes more pressure to do so since you need to also squeeze the trigger to lower it all the way. Makes holding a fist weird feeling when compared to other apps that also implement finger tracking, as the trigger spring is constantly pushing up on just the one finger.",
